fix: resolve bcrypt incompatibility, aiosqlite, and test ordering issues

- Replace bcrypt with pbkdf2_sha256 in security.py (passlib/bcrypt 4.x incompatibility)
- Use id-based ordering in PredictionRepository.get_history (created_at server_default issue)
- Fix async session.execute calls in test_repositories.py
- Replace MagicMock with _DummyModel for joblib serialization in tests
- Add aiosqlite as dev dependency